{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前出席「頑固台獨分子」沈伯洋競選造勢活動遭大陸輿論批評的台灣名嘴蔡康永今天（25日）發文稱，「我一直希望兩岸友好來往。</p><p>我沒有支持過台獨。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.875753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:24:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536546+00:00","content_hash":"38ce941b588ccaff36018e2c29e77e1f130f96c52cd959c5ee6eb93ac3ed07d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}